#: b04832819faa4ea6af6a7f9c80b978ca
msgid "This copter has a lot of things right and is really a study in good design and quality construction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:924
#: f1d2e9ea0d18446ebc4c2f02a11b8901
msgid "The rotating ball full enclosure camera Gimbal provides good weather protection and improved performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:926
#: 61266aad207f42c8a4881fe7cf1a85b2
msgid "The motors are on the bottom under the arms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:928
#: 2b884f0fa57c44eda3751453076ebfbf
msgid "More aerodynamically efficient with no prop wash interference and very little intake interference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:930
#: 57c6c52ce5ca46c995aee7fe699f93e6
msgid "Noticeably increased flight times, greater lift capability and quieter as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:933
#: b41a8d690d2c4b47b067bad3adc31354
msgid "High torque, low KV \"pancake\" style motors and slow turning, large diameter, high efficiency props."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:936
#: 8adf816fb4c94b4593b68dcb9a92ae7b
msgid "This is much more efficient than faster motors with smaller diameter conventional design props."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:938
#: 4224bed093444c15bc503122c2cad01b
msgid "This also increases flight times and load capacity and reduces the sound footprint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:941
#: 404072746ee64568b707dafa28466cd2
msgid "Tapered carbon fiber frame arms are more aerodynamically efficient and are light and very strong."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:943
#: d4a68a483dda40438d87785e10476f36
msgid "The fully enclosed weather tight framework with snap latch type access makes maintaining the copter easy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:945
#: 44e1c184a40547ea98e2114bb24942c6
msgid "A simple spring loaded landing gear provides for uneven landing sites and minimal interference with the prop wash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:951
#: e045aec820c24c2e8c747e5feea4b69e
msgid "This QuadCopter incorporates several excellent design concepts and shows what can be done without budget constraints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:954
#: 9b6bec13875e4d33a61d130ef50fefa6
msgid "The Skyranger has features we can use in our own designs but it is important to understand all designs are compromises."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:957
#: e6d8c8a23da64365b49046c3dbbd0a6f
msgid "The 3DRobotics Iris is one of the best designed QuadCopters that you can actually get and it is a real bargain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:961
#: 0b1214f7c6824d79b5ff48c895283c19
msgid "Conclusion and Additional Design Considerations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:963
#: 1f9a4c5e7a6140f7bb5a03f4b4b13407
msgid "I have not covered either 3D printing or CNC machining."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:965
#: c6df2d01cd254c8da54eb90099076535
msgid "These are both perfectly valid techniques for either whole frames or for parts or accessories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:967
#: 0a51d493da10412da44ec09ae0933c03
msgid "But most people do not have the equipment or capability which is why they are not covered here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:969
#: 47d9e493c7c94b389df6c4b3ac64f90f
msgid "Clearly if you have either of these capabilities they can greatly enhance your copter projects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:972
#: d69f6589584d4cb5b5a27d04c85e95ec
msgid "I have also not covered in depth hand laid fiberglass or carbon fiber or vacuum bagging."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:975
#: b19e27491e744b6a91cd79723c5fa431
msgid "You can make Dynamite frames or shells this way but this too requires serious individual skill  and capability (especially carbon fiber)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:979
#: a7517b9242e74a019a073b03126392dc
msgid "I have also not gone into detail about the engineering criteria for multicopters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:982
#: 8b4398b101854079aed9ecc5b956cbdf
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:983
#: ee17d040bd504b64a0bf3fa870ddaa89
msgid "From what I've seen very few people do."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:984
#: 8834a6d2f84f4883a5b34e649cfc962a
msgid "C. One who does is Paul Pounds PHD and here is his Paper on the subject: \\ `Quadrotors <http://eprints.qut.edu.au/33833/1/33833.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:987
#: 58b15f2e7709452397b3191cbeff885a
msgid "If you stick to a simple design and try to keep frame arm to a simple single small tube under the prop wash it will work fine."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:990
#: 47be3b58e2434d5d97293438f38369c0
msgid "Round tubing has about half the flat plate area (prop wash interference) as the same sized square tubing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:992
#: b042bddb58a44b5c84b36be28bff291e
msgid "You can improve efficiency by putting the motor prop under the frame arm but then there are frame design and clearance issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:995
#: 66d978e8f6dc426f98c00bdb9ad6613f
msgid "Try to keep the weight centralized as much as possible and keep the autopilot near the horizontal center if possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:998
#: 837f262efb654136b304cd8ff50fa355
msgid "So that the copter tends to roll and pitch as though pivoting around the center of mass and around the autopilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:1000
#: 4410201a78684440be96ebe9e437c606
msgid "However it is not as critical as some people have made it out to be because the stabilizing throttles will automatically compensate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:1004
#: b38a86320d074232a7f2c7f08766fc84
msgid "You can do a lot with a rudimentary understanding of the forces involved, if you need more it is a career, not a hobby."
msgstr ""
